Step 7 — Create server/src/services/paystack.service.js. Import axios. Base URL https://api.paystack.co. Headers: Authorization: Bearer process.env.PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY. Export async functions:
  - initializeTransaction({email, amountKobo, reference, metadata, callbackUrl}) → POST /transaction/initialize → returns {authorization_url, access_code, reference}
  - verifyTransaction(reference) → GET /transaction/verify/:reference → returns full data object
  - resolveAccountNumber({accountNumber, bankCode}) → GET /bank/resolve?account_number=&bank_code= → returns {account_name}
  - listBanks() → GET /bank?country=nigeria&perPage=100 → returns array of banks
  - createTransferRecipient({name, accountNumber, bankCode}) → POST /transferrecipient → returns {recipient_code}
  - initiateTransfer({amountKobo, recipientCode, reason, reference}) → POST /transfer → returns {transfer_code, status}
  - fetchTransfer(transferCode) → GET /transfer/:transferCode → returns full transfer object
  - getBalance() → GET /balance → returns {currency:'NGN', balance} (balance in kobo)
  All functions throw descriptive errors on non-2xx responses, including Paystack error message.
